rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on record since 1951. On that same middle, September to October ran 55% of normal in 2025 and October to November ran 57% in 2025. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 65% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29554 got 53% of normal in 1976.</p>"}
